<section class="mobile-page" data-mobile-app>
  <header class="mobile-hero"><div><p class="mobile-eyebrow">ACC / Mobile workspace</p><h1>Commerce that travels with you.</h1><p>Open your member workspace on Android, iPhone, or any modern browser. Your account, notifications, and activity stay connected to PostgreSQL.</p><div class="mobile-hero__actions"><button class="mobile-button mobile-button--light" type="button" data-install hidden>Install ACC</button><a class="mobile-button mobile-button--outline" href="/dashboard">Open workspace</a></div></div><div class="mobile-signal" aria-label="Connection status"><span data-connection-dot></span><strong data-connection-status>Checking connection</strong><small data-sync-status>Preparing secure sync</small></div></header>
  <section class="mobile-grid" aria-label="Mobile tools">
    <article class="mobile-card mobile-card--feature"><span class="mobile-card__number">01</span><h2>Work offline, catch up later</h2><p>Non-sensitive actions queue on this device and sync when you reconnect. Credentials and private records never enter browser storage.</p><button class="mobile-button mobile-button--dark" type="button" data-sync>Sync now</button></article>
    <article class="mobile-card"><span class="mobile-card__icon">+</span><h2>Capture from camera</h2><p>Send a compliant image or PDF directly from your phone.</p><form data-upload-form><label class="mobile-file"><span>Choose image or PDF</span><input type="file" name="document" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp,application/pdf" capture="environment" required></label><button class="mobile-button mobile-button--text" type="submit">Upload securely</button><output data-upload-status></output></form></article>
    <article class="mobile-card"><span class="mobile-card__icon">&deg;</span><h2>Find what is nearby</h2><p>Share your location only when you choose to improve nearby business and delivery experiences.</p><button class="mobile-button mobile-button--text" type="button" data-location>Share current location</button><output data-location-status></output></article>
    <article class="mobile-card"><span class="mobile-card__icon">!</span><h2>Stay in the loop</h2><p>Enable browser notifications where supported and keep notification preferences in one place.</p><a class="mobile-button mobile-button--text" href="/notifications">Manage notifications</a></article>
  </section>
  <section class="mobile-status-panel"><div><p class="mobile-eyebrow">Device registry</p><h2>Your connected access</h2><p>Each installation is identified without storing passwords or biometric data.</p></div><div class="mobile-stats"><strong><%= mobileSummary.devices.length %></strong><span>registered devices</span><strong><%= mobileSummary.queuedActions %></strong><span>queued actions</span><strong><%= mobileSummary.uploads %></strong><span>mobile uploads</span></div></section>
</section>
